      "limits": [
        "Window screenshots are about 28 MB at full size; the screenshot tool takes max_side to scale them down."
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Its live server connects with --bridge, where the other apps use --connect or --attach.",
        "Its headless server can keep unsaved work with --autosave; this repo does not pass it."
